    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {"@context":"http://schema.org","@graph":[{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"BPX Digital Securities Marketplace","url":"https://uk.linkedin.com/company/bpx-securities-exchange"},"datePublished":"2026-07-13T09:02:32.890Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":19},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/bpx-securities-exchange_hm-treasurys-wholesale-digital-markets-champion-activity-7482358797840134144-j9_I","text":"HM Treasury’s Wholesale Digital Markets Champion, Chris Woolard CBE today delivered the first report to the Chancellor setting out a programme of work for scaling tokenisation in the UK, boosting the UK’s global competitiveness and accelerating innovation across financial services.\n\nAs an Industry Taskforce member, BPX are proud to support the delivery of the programme, in collaboration with government and regulatory authorities, and supported by the City of London Corporation.\n\nThe ambition reflects the pace of international competition and the UK’s opportunity to lead the next generation of market infrastructure. The potential is significant. For the industry, this is not just about technology. It is about improving liquidity, reducing costs, enabling innovation and building a more resilient financial system.\n \nFind out more and read the report: \nhttps://lnkd.in/es4szFj4\nand \nhttps://lnkd.in/eCdnPsZ8","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/bpx-securities-exchange_hm-treasurys-wholesale-digital-markets-champion-activity-7482358797840134144-j9_I"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"BPX Digital Securities Marketplace","url":"https://uk.linkedin.com/company/bpx-securities-exchange"},"datePublished":"2026-06-25T07:02:03.881Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":37},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/bpx-securities-exchange_we-are-pleased-to-share-that-bpx-has-entered-activity-7475805495639916546-X-n7","text":"We are pleased to share that BPX has entered into an official partnership with Chainlink Labs to accelerate institutional adoption of digital financial markets.\n \nBPX is building a UK FCA-authorised marketplace that connects traditional and tokenised workflows across issuance, trading, lending, custody and settlement within a single, regulated and composable platform.\n\nChainlink’s industry-standard oracle platform, spanning secure data, cross-chain interoperability, compliance-aware workflows, and tokenised asset lifecycle standards, is highly aligned with BPX’s ambition to develop interoperable market infrastructure for regulated onchain finance.\n \nTogether, we are moving institutional markets beyond fragmented digital asset pilots towards connected, compliant, and scalable infrastructure for the next generation of securities markets.","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/bpx-securities-exchange_we-are-pleased-to-share-that-bpx-has-entered-activity-7475805495639916546-X-n7"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"BPX Digital Securities Marketplace","url":"https://uk.linkedin.com/company/bpx-securities-exchange"},"datePublished":"2026-06-16T11:00:51.620Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":31},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/bpx-securities-exchange_bpx-ownera-finp2p-activity-7472604099696545792-Q23R","text":"Ownera and BPX, Advance Capital Markets. \n \nWe’re pleased to announce that BPX is working with Ownera to support greater interoperability across regulated digital asset markets.\n \nThrough Ownera’s FinP2P application-orchestration infrastructure, BPX is enhancing interoperable transaction workflows across regulated digital asset environments, supporting the development of our integrated exchange, settlement and custody platform for traditional and tokenised securities.\n \nThis collaboration reflects BPX’s mission to help institutional capital markets transition from fragmented, legacy infrastructure towards more connected, compliant and scalable digital workflows.\n \nBy combining regulated marketplace infrastructure with interoperability-focused technology, BPX is helping to build the foundations for the next phase of digital securities markets.\nConnecting markets. Enabling interoperability. Advancing regulated digital assets.\n \n#BPX #Ownera #FinP2P #DigitalAssets #Tokenisation #CapitalMarkets #Securities #Interoperability #RegulatedMarkets\n","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/bpx-securities-exchange_bpx-ownera-finp2p-activity-7472604099696545792-Q23R"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"BPX Digital Securities Marketplace","url":"https://uk.linkedin.com/company/bpx-securities-exchange"},"datePublished":"2026-04-02T08:37:10.159Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":45},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/bpx-securities-exchange_bpx-clearbank-capitalmarkets-activity-7445388848794095616-oCRX","text":"We are delighted to welcome Charles McManus to BPX Digital Securities Marketplace as an advisor at such a pivotal moment for capital markets.\n \nCharles brings a rare combination of deep banking expertise, fintech innovation experience, and a proven track record of building and scaling regulated financial institutions from the ground up—experience that is directly aligned with BPX’s mission.\n \nHis insight and relationships will be invaluable as we continue to develop BPX as a next-generation market infrastructure, enabling the issuance, settlement, and trading of digital securities within a trusted regulatory framework.\n \nCharles’ perspective, shaped through close collaboration with regulators, institutions, and market participants, strongly aligns with our vision to modernise capital markets through tokenisation. We look forward to working together as we accelerate the transition towards more efficient and accessible financial markets. \n\n#BPX #ClearBank #CapitalMarkets #DigitalAssets #DigitalSecurities #Tokenisation #FundTokenisation #CapitalMarketInfrastructure #BlockchainInFinance #FinTech ","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/bpx-securities-exchange_bpx-clearbank-capitalmarkets-activity-7445388848794095616-oCRX"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"BPX Digital Securities Marketplace","url":"https://uk.linkedin.com/company/bpx-securities-exchange"},"datePublished":"2026-03-18T09:42:03.121Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":70},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/bpx-securities-exchange_investec-bpx-capitalmarkets-activity-7439969359034236928-T5gc","text":"We’re delighted to welcome Investec as the first member of BPX Digital Securities Marketplace, marking an important milestone in the development of our digital securities marketplace.\n\nBPX was created to reimagine how capital markets operate — enabling the creation, issuance, settlement and trading of securities through modern, digital infrastructure.\n\nAchieving this vision requires forward-thinking institutions willing to engage with new market models and help shape the future.\n\nInvestec’s decision to join BPX reflects their commitment to innovation.\n\nWe look forward to working closely with Investec as we continue this journey to build a securities marketplace that is \"OutoftheOrdinary\" !\n\nThis is only the beginning. Together with our members, we are building the foundations of a more efficient, transparent and digitally native market structure.\n\n#Investec #BPX #CapitalMarkets #DigitalAssets #DigitalSecurities #Tokenisation #FundTokenisation #CapitalMarketInfrastructure #BlockchainInFinance","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/bpx-securities-exchange_investec-bpx-capitalmarkets-activity-7439969359034236928-T5gc"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"BPX Digital Securities Marketplace","url":"https://uk.linkedin.com/company/bpx-securities-exchange","address":{"type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"83 Baker Street","addressLocality":"London","addressRegion":"England","postalCode":"W1U 6AG","addressCountry":"GB"},"description":"BPX is an FCA-authorised Digital Securities Marketplace and Settlement Venue.\n\nOur mission is to unlock access and liquidity across alternative and digital assets, empowering both issuers and investors.\n\nBy combining multiple services within a single marketplace, BPX streamlines the entire securities lifecycle on the foundations of distributed ledger technology.\n\nOur platform brings together fund management, primary issuance, secondary trading, and collateralised lending, delivering greater efficiency and transparency. BPX is also authorised to provide custody of digital securities and will soon enable Delivery-versus-Payment (DvP) settlement finality for digital assets.","numberOfEmployees":{"value":22,"@type":"QuantitativeValue"},"logo":{"contentUrl":"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E0BAQFvR07PiqnIyw/company-logo_200_200/company-logo_200_200/0/1682849853560?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=OuaJQEwDZHy13rYl1WxMUBbWaktVq1cQzos-uZQH6xw","description":"BPX Digital Securities Marketplace","@type":"ImageObject"},"slogan":"Access + Liquidity ","sameAs":"https://bpx.exchange/"}]}
    </script>
  
  
      
