<!---->
          <h2 class="core-section-container__title section-title">
            About us
          </h2>

<!---->
      <div class="core-section-container__content break-words">
        

          <p class="break-words text-color-text" data-test-id="about-us__description">
              BPX is an FCA-authorised Digital Securities Marketplace and Settlement Venue.

Our mission is to unlock access and liquidity across alternative and digital assets, empowering both issuers and investors.

By combining multiple services within a single marketplace, BPX streamlines the entire securities lifecycle on the foundations of distributed ledger technology.

Our platform brings together fund management, primary issuance, secondary trading, and collateralised lending, delivering greater efficiency and transparency. BPX is also authorised to provide custody of digital securities and will soon enable Delivery-versus-Payment (DvP) settlement finality for digital assets.
          </p>

