  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">HM Treasury’s Wholesale Digital Markets Champion, Chris Woolard CBE today delivered the first report to the Chancellor setting out a programme of work for scaling tokenisation in the UK, boosting the UK’s global competitiveness and accelerating innovation across financial services.

As an Industry Taskforce member, BPX are proud to support the delivery of the programme, in collaboration with government and regulatory authorities, and supported by the City of London Corporation.

The ambition reflects the pace of international competition and the UK’s opportunity to lead the next generation of market infrastructure. The potential is significant. For the industry, this is not just about technology. It is about improving liquidity, reducing costs, enabling innovation and building a more resilient financial system.
 
Find out more and read the report: 
<a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/es4szFj4?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/es4szFj4</a>
and 
