  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">We are pleased to share that BPX has entered into an official partnership with Chainlink Labs to accelerate institutional adoption of digital financial markets.
 
BPX is building a UK FCA-authorised marketplace that connects traditional and tokenised workflows across issuance, trading, lending, custody and settlement within a single, regulated and composable platform.

Chainlink’s industry-standard oracle platform, spanning secure data, cross-chain interoperability, compliance-aware workflows, and tokenised asset lifecycle standards, is highly aligned with BPX’s ambition to develop interoperable market infrastructure for regulated onchain finance.
 
Together, we are moving institutional markets beyond fragmented digital asset pilots towards connected, compliant, and scalable infrastructure for the next generation of securities markets.</p>
